      "id": "43e578a5-87ab-4862-a45c-9484c347b5b1",
      "name": "Google Services",
      "description": {
        "content": "Note\n\nApplicable to be used only by paid listings clients, for their active locations, for the Google Services section, in the Google listing.\nNo two services should have the same service name. It is recommended that all services created should  HAVE UNIQUE service names.\nYou CAN have the same service across two diff categories e.g.: Emergency counselling as a $100 paid service can be a service created &amp; mapped to category A - Mental health and category B - Psychotherapy - both categories being present for the same location.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
